  "changelog": [
    {
      "date": "2026-10-08",
      "note": "Initial capture as user 1 on Asta's Projects section. Project names, counts, people, trash rows and Jira/Huly project lists are shared live data and never asserted by value. Only read-only controls are used; the Create Project and Project Settings dialogs are cancelled, nothing is saved, archived, trashed, restored, imported or deleted. The project detail view is a separate module."
